    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coloring Book</strong> is a fun and creative coloring game designed for kids and anyone who loves to explore colors! With an easy-to-use interface and unique features, it offers a relaxing and enjoyable coloring experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Patterns </strong>\u2013 Bring your artwork to life with beautiful patterns!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Realistic Color Mixing</strong> \u2013 Use the sample tool not just to pick colors but to mix them, just like real paint. Create your own unique palette!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Kid-Friendly Interface</strong> \u2013 Simple, intuitive controls make it easy for kids to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Controller Support</strong> \u2013 Perfect for playing on the Steam Deck or with a gamepad (Don't ask me why).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your creativity shine and enjoy the joy of coloring! \ud83c\udf08</p>",
